{"version":3,"createdAt":1791626547051,"mainModel":{"schemaVersion":8,"id":"cm_mv284foc","key":"cm_mv284foc","name":"Planchard Chapter9 - review Q1-Q19 - browser 2026-10-10","kind":"part","authoringMode":"fully-parametric","localFrame":{"origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"yAxis":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"zAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},"references":[{"id":"origin","type":"origin","name":"Origin","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:top","type":"plane","name":"Top Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:front","type":"plane","name":"Front Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1},"xAxis":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"plane:right","type":"plane","name":"Right Plane","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"normal":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0},"xAxis":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}},{"id":"axis:x","type":"axis","name":"X Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":1,"y":0,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:y","type":"axis","name":"Y Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":1,"z":0}},{"id":"axis:z","type":"axis","name":"Z Axis","origin":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0},"direction":{"x":0,"y":0,"z":1}}],"parameters":{},"sketches":[{"id":"sk_2a8fq","name":"X·Z sketch","plane":"top","offset":0,"referenceId":"plane:top","points":[],"entities":[],"constraints":[],"diagnostics":[],"status":"fully-defined"}],"features":[],"history":[],"parts":[],"assemblies":[],"appearances":[],"notes":[],"markups":[],"rules":{},"metadata":{"authoringSystem":"parametric-v1"},"topologyBindings":[],"namedSelections":[],"revision":1,"lastRebuild":{"ok":true,"signature":"{\"definitionId\":\"cm_mv284foc\",\"features\":[],\"history\":[{\"id\":\"history:sketch:sk_2a8fq\",\"kind\":\"sketch\",\"suppressed\":false,\"targetId\":\"sk_2a8fq\"}],\"overrides\":{},\"revision\":1,\"sketches\":[{\"constraints\":[],\"entities\":[],\"id\":\"sk_2a8fq\",\"name\":\"X·Z sketch\",\"offset\":0,\"plane\":\"top\",\"points\":[],\"referenceId\":\"plane:top\"}]}","issues":[],"rebuiltAt":1791626538561},"price":500,"col":"#c9bfae","constraints":[],"rollback":null,"activeSketch":"sk_2a8fq","variables":[],"referenceGeometry":[],"definitionId":"cm_mv284foc","documentVersion":1,"context":{"kind":"part","units":{"length":"mm","angle":"deg","mass":"kg","precision":3},"activeCoordinateSystemId":"origin"},"customProperties":{"Description":"Source printed9-38-39 / PDF472-473, Planchard2021 Chapter9 review Q1-Q19. Independent source-grounded explanations of drawings, drawing templates/sheet formats, view placement, notes, assembly BOM/balloons, configurations/design tables and center of mass annotations; ordinary browser Drawing notes. No official answer-key, newly authored CAD or certification claim."},"drawing":{"version":1,"draftingStandard":"custom","secondaryUnits":"","secondaryPrecision":2,"size":"A3","orientation":"landscape","projection":"third","units":"mm","scale":"fit","showHidden":true,"showCenters":true,"showZones":true,"views":[],"dims":[],"notes":[{"id":"n2itqug1","x":34.755904449194375,"y":24.64126801587906,"text":"CHAPTER9 - REVIEW ANSWERS Q1-Q19\nSource: printed9-38/39 / PDF472/473, Planchard2021.\nIndependent explanations with drawing procedure examples.\nNo official answer-key, authored CAD or certification claim.","leader":null},{"id":"nobraqie","x":34.755904449194375,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q1 - Drawing template/format\nTemplate sets document standard,units,precision and starting defaults;Sheet\nFormat defines border/titleblock/logo/static fields. A template can\nreference a format.","leader":null},{"id":"nrthfuyd","x":34.755904449194375,"y":78.71410309387437,"text":"Q2 - Save Sheet Format\nBook:File→Save Sheet Format,producing.slddrt.","leader":null},{"id":"ndd9eh9a","x":34.755904449194375,"y":90.73028662951322,"text":"Q3 - Save Drawing Template\nBook:File→Save As and choose Drawing Templates(*.drwdot).","leader":null},{"id":"npc63r18","x":34.755904449194375,"y":102.74647016515206,"text":"Q4 - BOM\nA Bill of Materials lists assembly component/item identifiers,part\nnumbers,descriptions,quantities and optionally materials. Example:LINKS has\nfour distinct source part-number rows with corresponding balloons.","leader":null},{"id":"n888vf4i","x":34.755904449194375,"y":121.77208798483323,"text":"Q5 - Drawing modes\nEdit Sheet Format and Edit Sheet. Format mode edits the\nborder/titleblock;Sheet mode edits views,dimensions and drawing\nannotations.","leader":null},{"id":"nmreu0ls","x":34.755904449194375,"y":140.7977058045144,"text":"Q6 - Seven titleblock fields\nCompany/organization;drawing title/description;drawing\nnumber;revision;drawn-by;date;scale. Size,units,material,weight,approvals\nand tolerances are additional common fields.","leader":null},{"id":"nir56ko9","x":34.755904449194375,"y":159.8233419594366,"text":"Q7 - Insert Isometric\nBook:use Model View/View Palette,select the part/assembly and isometric\norientation,then place and set view scale/display style. ModelForge's\nDrawing view controls provide the equivalent view insertion.","leader":null},{"id":"nwos7vvh","x":34.755904449194375,"y":178.84895977911776,"text":"Q8 - Drawing extension\n.slddrw in SOLIDWORKS. ModelForge uses its own project bundle plus exported\nSVG and must not mislabel those.slddrw.","leader":null},{"id":"ndhlttep","x":34.755904449194375,"y":194.36986962439826,"text":"Q9 - TimesNewRoman/lowercase\nFalse. Engineering lettering prioritizes readable consistent lettering;the\nsource uses standard drafting fonts such as Century Gothic and generally\nuppercase drawing notes,not all-lowercaseTimesNewRoman.","leader":null},{"id":"nt3jmn0t","x":34.755904449194375,"y":213.39548744407944,"text":"Q10 - Leader\nA thin annotation line connecting a note/symbol to a feature,with an\nappropriate arrow/dot end. Example:aØholeTHRU callout pointing at the hole.","leader":null},{"id":"n6i4fge7","x":225.01213765172912,"y":59.6884669389522,"text":"Q11 - Drawing Note\nText conveying information not efficiently expressed by\ngeometry/dimensions,e.g.material,finish or a linked thickness note. An\nassociative note can read the model property.","leader":null},{"id":"ntq9my3u","x":225.01213765172912,"y":78.71410309387437,"text":"Q12 - Exploded assembly drawing\nCreate/save an exploded configuration/view in the assembly;insert an\nassembly drawing view selecting that configuration and enable its exploded\nstate. Keep the underlying assembly's collapse/edit state available.","leader":null},{"id":"nsa4dcf2","x":225.01213765172912,"y":97.73972091355554,"text":"Q13 - Label exploded components\nInsert BOM,then attach balloons to component occurrences;balloon item\nnumbers correspond to BOM rows. Example:LINKS four occurrence balloons/four\nsource part numbers.","leader":null},{"id":"nqpnrmdp","x":225.01213765172912,"y":116.76533873323672,"text":"Q14 - Design Table\nBook:Insert→Tables→Design Table;choose creation method,add configuration\nrows and dimension/feature/property columns,enter values,and close/update.\nO-RING path/profile dimensions define Small/Medium/Large. ModelForge's\nnative table is an equivalent,not an Excel automation claim.","leader":null},{"id":"njojeq8k","x":225.01213765172912,"y":139.29568286255957,"text":"Q15 - No multiple configurations on sheet\nFalse. Each drawing view can reference a chosen configuration;different\nconfigurations can appear on the same sheet.","leader":null},{"id":"n2xwy2ox","x":225.01213765172912,"y":154.81659270784007,"text":"Q16 - Part number only in BOM\nFalse. It can originate from configuration/component/custom properties and\nalso appear in linked drawing notes/titleblocks;the BOM reads its selected\nproperty.","leader":null},{"id":"n68l4nxg","x":225.01213765172912,"y":173.84221052752125,"text":"Q17 - Find detailed options help\nUse context/PropertyManager help,SOLIDWORKS Help/search and relevant\ntutorials;the book's menus are2021source instructions.","leader":null},{"id":"ny1hy7x7","x":225.01213765172912,"y":189.36312037280175,"text":"Q18 - View Palette\nA task-pane collection of available standard/model views from the selected\nmodel that can be dragged onto a sheet. It helps insert views but does not\ndetermine source dimensions by itself.","leader":null},{"id":"numt33fi","x":225.01213765172912,"y":208.38873819248292,"text":"Q19 - COM in drawing\nFirst create a Center of Mass feature in the part/assembly via\nInsert→Reference Geometry→Center of Mass or Mass Properties'createCOM\noption. In Drawing use Insert→Model Items→Reference Geometry→Center of Mass\nand accept. Its location updates with model mass distribution;it is\ndistinct from a frozen COM Reference Point. Source PDF470–471/9-36–37.","leader":null}],"primitives":[],"title":{"revision":"A","sheet":1,"sheets":1,"title":"CHAPTER9 - REVIEW Q1-Q19","number":"PLANCHARD9-38/39-PDF472/473","author":"","company":"","material":"","finish":"","mass":"","date":"2026-10-10","tolerance":""},"seeded":true},"lastStandardsAudit":{"at":1791626529262,"ok":true,"checked":0,"blocking":[]},"exactTopologyCache":{}},"assemblies":[],"drawings":[],"metadata":{"generator":"ModelForge CAD SolidWorks-Class","units":"mm","attachmentStorage":"content-addressed","activeDocument":{"type":"part","key":"cm_mv284foc"}},"attachments":[]}